{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中國載人航天工程辦公室表示，空間站應用與發展階段飛行任務總指揮部定於早上9時，在酒泉衛星發射中心召開神舟二十四號載人飛行任務新聞發布會，通報任務有關情況。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:22:59.634310+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:04:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:17:18.550236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:32.437732+00:00","content_hash":"5c46b05cc1c2cf931ef5fac2919b10baa101600a6d6b4c011e35cda36794fefc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}